## Why Choose Rhythm Culture?

No hidden charges. Instruments are provided for all students at no extra cost.

Enjoy Rhythm Culture artists all over Australia with no extra travel costs.

Experience full size authentic instruments that sound beautiful and are comfortable to play.

All Rhythm Culture have been trained and studied in Africa. Learn authentic rhythms and dances.

