## What Our Schools are Saying

“We loved the way the show engaged all children 100% of the time. They loved having their own individual drum!! There was a great balance between listening to various instruments and moving to beat of the music with instruments in hand, and the enjoyment of being involved in some of the dances!! See you next year and thank you!”

“Our children enjoyed a fabulous learning experience with Rhythm Culture. Children were thrilled to be able to work as a team to produce various rhythms“

“I just wanted to pass on my thanks to you and Nathaniel for organising and providing such a wonderful drumming performance at our Woodford, Deception Bay and Caboolture sites. I have received glowing reports from my staff.  Please pass on my congratulations to Nathaniel for providing such great and engaging entertainment for our children and families. My staff have all commented on how much the children and families enjoyed the show and how delighted the children were.”
